00:00:34.734 --> 00:00:36.269
- Terima kasih banyak.
-yah 

00:00:43.443 --> 00:00:44.844
Oh, begitu ya.

00:00:46.479 --> 00:00:47.480
Baik, saya mengerti.

00:00:48.014 --> 00:00:50.350
Ya, biar kami yang urus di sini.

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:52.218
Ya.

00:00:58.758 --> 00:00:59.759
Natsumori.

00:00:59.926 --> 00:01:00.660
Ya.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:01.861
