00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:12.265
Apa maksudmu? Dia harus terus cari pengalaman di lapangan supaya bisa cepat berkembang.

00:02:12.866 --> 00:02:13.867
Benar, kan?

00:02:14.467 --> 00:02:15.468
I-iya, benar.

00:02:15.768 --> 00:02:16.769
